{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02818","headline":"还赴蜀中贻示京邑游好 · 卢照邻","name":"还赴蜀中贻示京邑游好","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"籞宿花初满，章台柳向飞。\n如何正此日，还望昔多违。\n怅别风期阻，将乖云会稀。\n歛衽辞丹阙，悬旗陟翠微。\n野禽喧戍鼓，春草变征衣。\n回顾长安道，关山起夕霏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}